Third-party components
----------------------

None. Belief has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim
on 25/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used to write the exports

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

A note on the demonstrations
----------------------------

Every result in this app is computed from the reader's own answers. No population
statistic, study finding or prevalence figure appears anywhere in it, and the app says
so under each result. The mechanisms are described, not cited: citing a number nobody
in this repository measured would be worse than describing the mechanism without one.
